<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to May 9.</p>
<p>    Top 10 gains in week	    Price  percent</p>
<p>Rank Name				 May 9  change</p>
<p> 1  Futuris Corp	   2.10     9.95</p>
<p> 2  Hardie Inds	    4.15     9.21</p>
<p> 3  Santos		   5.50     8.91</p>
